1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,080
I am Alice, Integrity Knight!

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,160
Alice Synthesis 30!

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:14,697
I am the Proxy of the Three
Goddesses, who protect this realm!

4
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,500
I am the Priestess of Light,

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,840
and whoever dares defy me shall
know the fury of my power!

6
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,370
Alice...

7
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:29,890
Alicia...

8
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,037
This time...

9
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,680
This time her soul will be mine.

10
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,300
And once I have the light cube that
holds her Flux light in my hands,

11
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,660
I'm going to savor every last bite.

12
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,230
Subjects!

13
00:00:46,313 --> 00:00:47,182
Your attention!

14
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,300
We are heading south.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,765
Pugilists in the lead, then Dark
Knights, then the Supply Corps.

16
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:58,740
That Knight is the Priestess of Light
and she is to be captured unharmed.

17
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,580
You're only one.

18
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:48,500
I can not forget this answer?

19
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:50,637
It's not random!

20
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,896
I can't wait for it!

21
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,017
I can't be a dream!

22
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:56,041
I can't find it!

23
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,077
I can't be a dream!

24
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:02,177
I can't be a dream!

25
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:05,037
I'm not a dream! I'm not a dream!

26
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,355
I need to be a dream!

27
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:14,260
I can't be a dream!

28
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:44,220
Oh!

29
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,780
The plan's working a little too well.

30
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:01,182
Vector's got his whole
army coming after you now.

31
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:04,320
He's obsessed with you,
no doubt about that.

32
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,540
We should be thankful he is.

33
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:10,000
It is much better than
being ignored entirely.

34
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,117
Alright, let's talk about strategy.

35
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,677
I was thinking me and
the troops keep leading

36
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,525
them south and slowly
chip away at their ranks.

37
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:21,200
Seems like the best approach. Agreed.

38
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:24,244
We have already wiped out
half of their numbers.

39
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:27,617
That leaves their main force,
the Dark Knights and Pugilists.

40
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:29,497
Chasing us will wear them down.

41
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,900
And if we can defeat Emperor Vecta,

42
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:36,700
I have hope the remaining people of
this land will be open to a truce. Hmm.

43
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,868
That's a good hope to have.

44
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:42,826
Problem is, who's going to be in
charge here when Vecta's gone?

45
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,577
If only that punk Shasta
was still alive then it

46
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:49,760
is true the general of
the dark knights is dead.

47
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:54,037
Yeah I didn't see him or
his number two out there

48
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:56,944
he would have been our
best shot to reason with.

49
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:06,017
I finished my reconnaissance
sir the shrubland

50
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,512
south of here should work for our ambush.

51
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:10,822
Thanks for checking it out, kid.

52
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,697
Tell the units and get
them ready to move out.

53
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:16,640
That dragon of yours
must be exhausted by now.

54
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:20,500
Make sure it gets food and
water before we go. Sir!

55
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:27,720
What is it? Oh, nothing.

56
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:29,200
I was just thinking.

57
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:32,937
Part of me's glad there won't
be any more synthesis rituals.

58
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:35,257
I mean, having your
memory and life stolen,

59
00:04:35,340 --> 00:04:38,046
that's a horrible price
to pay to be a knight.

60
00:04:39,060 --> 00:04:39,890
But then,

61
00:04:39,973 --> 00:04:42,017
part of me is also kind of
sad if we won't be seeing

62
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:44,982
any more young 'uns like
Renly joining the Order.

63
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:46,700
Perhaps we won't.

64
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:50,494
However, stolen memories and
lives do not make a knight.

65
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,700
I know of no such rule, Uncle. Do you?

66
00:04:56,280 --> 00:05:00,640
When we are all gone, our
souls, our will, our purpose,

67
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:04,420
they remain to inspire
those we leave behind.

68
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,900
That is what I believe.

69
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:21,100
Here they come.

70
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:27,140
Damn pugilists.

71
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:29,600
They'll be a handful for us.

72
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:33,377
If you hit them with your bare
fists, they'll happily take it.

73
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:37,048
But if you come at them with a
sword, they refuse to get cut.

74
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,580
What? Refuse?

75
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,152
Yep, that's what I said.

76
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,997
See, the more training they go through,

77
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:45,117
the more they think a sword's
nothing to be scared of.

78
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:47,037
So watch out when you fight them,

79
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:51,649
because they can will their skin to get
hard, and they can deflect any blade.

80
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:56,649
We'll have to keep them busy, till the
others are in position for the ambush.

81
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:00,600
I shall go and face them.

82
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:21,084
I can't wait to fight one of them
super-strong Integrity Knights!

83
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,340
Who are you supposed to be?

84
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:35,108
And why are you in the way?

85
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:41,810
Hmm.

86
00:06:41,893 --> 00:06:42,723
I am a knight.

87
00:06:42,806 --> 00:06:45,027
I am here to keep you
from advancing further.

88
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:49,388
By the looks of you, you couldn't
stop a kid from getting by.

89
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:50,820
Wait, let me guess.

90
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:53,540
All you can do is cast arts, right?

91
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,550
Hmm.

92
00:06:55,633 --> 00:06:57,500
I am not skilled in formal arts.

93
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,230
Whatever.

94
00:07:01,313 --> 00:07:02,440
Go kick her ass, Yote.

95
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:03,680
You got it!

96
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,960
Just you then?

97
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:13,025
I'm way more than you
can handle, you beanpole!

98
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,442
Now shut up and draw your sword!

99
00:07:24,620 --> 00:07:25,796
Damn, that's skinny.

100
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,420
I'll break you in half!

101
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:56,980
I've heard that you prefer
keeping to yourself.

102
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:59,120
Why is that, I wonder?

103
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,557
Do people scare you?

104
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:08,000
Or perhaps, your urge to
slice them scares you.

105
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,540
I knew it.

106
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,960
I can see in your eyes that it does.

107
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:17,760
If you had your way, you'd
slice up everything in sight.

108
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:21,480
You feel like you're cursed
with a drive for murder.

109
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,470
Cheer up.

110
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,037
There's no reason to
feel ashamed about it.

111
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:30,080
In fact, I can help you
use it to your advantage.

112
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:36,169
On your last reconnaissance
mission into the Dark Territory,

113
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:38,580
you brought this flower back to me.

114
00:08:38,860 --> 00:08:43,684
It absorbed massive amounts of the spatial
resources generated on the battlefield.

115
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:46,457
I will turn it into your divine object,

116
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:50,980
a sword with the highest priority
level that can cut through anything.

117
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:09,720
With this sword, you shall wield a manifestation
of the curse carved into your soul.

118
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:13,182
Take it and serve me with
your murderous impulse.

119
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:16,800
The curse you were born
with now has a purpose.

120
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:20,060
Slice and hack and slash away.

121
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:22,811
And at the end of your blood-smeared path,

122
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,607
you will find the key
to breaking your curse.

123
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:27,600
At least, you might.

124
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:48,757
What a savage fighting
style and yet as violent

125
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:52,497
as her attacks are I do
not detect any hostility or

126
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:56,577
any emotion for that
matter I've known her for

127
00:09:56,660 --> 00:10:00,120
more than a hundred years
and I still have no idea?

128
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:02,320
what goes on in her head.

129
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:03,677
Not even a clue.

130
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:06,289
Don't worry about her,
she can handle them.

131
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:09,917
But we should go before
the main force catches up.

132
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:14,000
Come on, we have to make sure
everyone's ready and waiting for them.

133
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:15,290
Right.

134
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,765
All the units are in position.

135
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:35,720
According to Commander Bercoli, the
pugilists are vulnerable to sacred arts.

136
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:39,220
The planes might not have
enough spatial resources,

137
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:42,380
but here, there's at
least some vegetation,

138
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:46,821
so the priests should have enough
sacred power to launch an attack.

139
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:51,340
Hopefully it'll cause confusion, and
we can use our dragons to burn them.

140
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:56,620
Are the supply corps somewhere safe?

141
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:58,210
Yes.

142
00:10:58,293 --> 00:10:59,701
They're standing by to the south.

143
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,657
They're far enough back that they
won't get caught in the battle.

144
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,420
Very good. Thank you.

145
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:29,640
Come on, man.

146
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,297
I'm getting bored sitting
around giving orders.

147
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:35,556
How's about we go outside
and have ourselves some fun?

148
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:38,640
No thanks, but you can
go first if you want to.

149
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,700
I'll pick a spot.

150
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:45,020
There, in those woods.

151
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:49,265
That better be where the action
is or I'm gonna be disappointed.

152
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,957
I guarantee you'll have fun.

153
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,260
P-King, that is.

154
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,240
Five down, baby.

155
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,220
How dare you!

156
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:20,300
You're gonna pay for this! Yes!

157
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:28,255
These fists are mine.

158
00:12:28,660 --> 00:12:30,720
Your armor's nothing but paper!

159
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,240
Well, well, well.

160
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:05,933
You might look like a girl,
but you're as hard as a rock.

161
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,700
I am not a girl.

162
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:11,020
I am older than you. Huh?

163
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:13,020
Yeah, I know you are.

164
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,797
You're an Integrity Knight.

165
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:17,797
You're all supposed to be
immortal freaks or whatever.

166
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,710
So what?

167
00:13:18,793 --> 00:13:21,191
Do you want me to call you Granny instead?

168
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,880
I'll allow it.

169
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:27,340
However, you are also freakish.

170
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:31,160
Your skin is so hard, I
could barely cut into it.

171
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,180
Deal with it, Granny.

172
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:34,610
Besides,

173
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:39,524
folks like us need an edge against you
knights but with your demon powers and all.

174
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:42,032
You charged in and chopped up all my pe -

175
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,660
You maimed him.

176
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,979
You were holding back, weren't you?

177
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:56,180
What do you think we
are, training dummies?

178
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:58,060
You're taking pity on us?

179
00:14:00,100 --> 00:14:02,394
I'm gonna beat you to death personally!

180
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:31,620
Here I come, woman!

181
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:43,980
What did you expect?

182
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:46,396
That all his putilists did was punch?

183
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:50,210
See ya!

184
00:15:08,860 --> 00:15:12,801
Now that your armor's gone, you're
looking way more like a fighter.

185
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,777
Although, you don't got
nearly enough muscles.

186
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:17,917
You should eat and train more.

187
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:22,337
Woman, as should you,

188
00:15:22,420 --> 00:15:25,457
just now you became a bit softer.

189
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:28,717
Are you calling soft?

190
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,757
I was just getting warmed up.

191
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:34,277
Now that I am, you're
gonna see me at full power.

192
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,817
So don't hold back.

193
00:15:35,900 --> 00:15:36,977
Give me all you got.

194
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,097
Then wipe that.

195
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:40,180
Sleepy look off your face already!

196
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:49,280
I trust that will suffice. Come then.

197
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,340
Alright, you asked for it.

198
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:29,120
I'm so fired up for this.

199
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,760
I never fought anyone like her before.

200
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:48,380
Strange how I allow
this battle to continue.

201
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:51,517
It must be this one's attack.

202
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:54,697
He seems weak everywhere except his fists.

203
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:58,257
But he displays a will worthy
of an Integrity Knight.

204
00:16:58,340 --> 00:17:01,157
I could end this by cutting off his head.

205
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:05,940
I should, but I wonder if I
can slice through that fist.

206
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,360
This is fun.

207
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:15,357
Even though she looks like
some weak upper class lady

208
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:19,377
from the human empire deep
down She's the same as me.

209
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:23,457
Oh she's gonna overpower me.

210
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:29,160
Oh well if I'm gonna die
this ain't a bad way to go.

211
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:40,280
What in the hell did
you do that for, Donpa?

212
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:42,167
We're out of time, champion.

213
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,889
Main force is almost here.

214
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:48,480
Hey, woman!

215
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:51,292
Don't you go thinking you won this fight!

216
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:53,940
Look here.

217
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,380
I do have a name.

218
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,200
Not woman. Whatever.

219
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:02,327
The main force is almost here
and we got you surrounded, so...

220
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:09,740
Lousy dragons.

221
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:11,400
Go on and go!

222
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:14,537
But at least tell me your
name before you run away!

223
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:16,280
I am not running away.

224
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:20,880
And for your information,
my name is ShetaSynthesis12.

225
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:42,580
That's it.

226
00:18:42,780 --> 00:18:44,560
A little closer.

227
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,580
Sup, baby doll.

228
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:59,040
How'd you spot me?

229
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,617
It wasn't too hard.

230
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:04,740
My mentor taught me to trust
my senses, not my eyes. What?

231
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,532
Where have I heard that?

232
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,180
Wake up!

233
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:10,440
The enemy's here!

234
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:23,920
Oh, boys!

235
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,580
Time to party!

236
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:34,830
What?

237
00:19:34,913 --> 00:19:36,240
The enemies behind us?

238
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:37,400
Dozens of them?

239
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:41,280
If they destroy our supplies,
we will be immobilized.

240
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:44,226
And those two girls and
Kirito are back there.

241
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,780
I should send backup.

242
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:49,560
But if I do, the enemy
will know about our ambush.

243
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,840
Or could they already know?

244
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:55,797
Maybe I should send all of
these troops back to help.

245
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,517
I guess they figured we'd head
this way after we broke through.

246
00:19:58,600 --> 00:20:01,365
So they stuck some troops
down here to meet us.

247
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:03,090
Commander!

248
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,840
Hmm, Renly.

249
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:08,380
Get the troops up and out of here.

250
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:10,958
Kiddo, go and help the Supply Corps.

251
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:13,437
I'll stay here and hold off the pugilists.

252
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:14,350
Understood?

253
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,270
Sir!

254
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:18,360
You say you'll hold them off. But how?

255
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:20,220
They are 5,000.

256
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:21,780
You are but one.

257
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:24,380
Kid, don't worry. I got this.

258
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:25,920
Now get going.

259
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,360
All right, then.

260
